    "Id": "mechdef_urbanmech_UM-R62",
    "Name": "UrbanMech UM-R62",
    "Details": "An unusual Urbanmech, the UM-R62 trades firepower for range. The removal of the standard weapons systems allows for the installation of an AC/2 and a PPC, inverting the usual Urbanmech load out. Deployed as a fire support and AA mech alongside infantry and armor units, the UM-R62’s range more than makes up for its slow speed and lack of heavy firepower.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: 360° Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.97</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_urbanmech"
  },
